1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Christian Chensvold Memorial Photos Flowers Edit Share Learn about upgrading this memorial... Birth: 	Jun. 12, 1869, Norway Death: 	Nov. 22, 1945 Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Per church records Christian Chensvold was born June 12 1869 to Arnt and Siller-Marie(Iverson) Chensvold in Stavanger Norge.
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian married Berthine Tjelmene on March 3,1897. To this union 6 children were born: Arndt Magnus, Bertha Andrina, Esther Bertha, Myrtle A, Edwin O and Cora Beata.
2 CONT
2 CONT On November 22,1945 Christian passed away. He is buried at the First Lutheran Church Cemetery. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Berthine Tjelmene Chensvold (1868 - 1965)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT
