1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See the above profile photo 1865 Stavanger, Rogaland, Norway census showing Sina Olsen born 1852, Celilie born 1853, father Henrik Olsen b1823 and mother Nille Thorsdatter Idzoe b1831. Sina then married Ola Peterso
2 CONC n in Stavanger, Norway by 1875. She named her second daughter, Cecelia, after her sister in Norway(Norwegian spelling was Cecilie). Henrik and Nille Olsen apparently did not leave Norway but daughter Sina's family did go to Long I
2 CONC sland, NY, USA by 1901.
