2 CONT
2 CONT Berthine Tjelmene Chensvold
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Mar. 6, 1868, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Nov. 14, 1965 West Union Fayette County Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Per church records plus Obituary
2 CONT
2 CONT Berthine Tjelmene was born to Andrew & Bertha (Nelson) Tjelmene on March 6, 1868 in Sand, Stavanger, Norge.
2 CONT
2 CONT Berthine Tjelmene married Christian Chensvold on March 3,1897. To this union 6 children were born; Arndt Magnus, Bertha Andrina, Esther Bertha, Myrtle A, Edwin O and Cora Beata.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs Berthine Chensvold, 97, a long-time resident of West Union, IA, died Sunday November 14,1965, at the home of her son, Edwin of West Union, IA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Services will be Wednesday November 17 at Bethany Lutheran Church, rural West Union. The Rev. Wallace Jackson will officiate. Burial will be in the First Lutheran Cemetery, Rural Ossian, Iowa. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse:
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian Chensvold (1869 - 1945)
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: First Lutheran Cemetery (Ossian)  Winneshiek County Iowa, USA
