2 CONC age was later solemnized in the St. George Temple. She died Nov. 11, 1966. He was a former resident of Panguitch and Delta, Utah. Survivors: sons and daughters, Gene, Midvale; Samuel and John both of Delta; Mrs. A. T. (Norma) Heil
2 CONC , Reedley, Calif.; Mrs. N. L. (Irene) Wilder, San Francisco, Calif.; Mrs. Robert (Janice) Hodgen, Monterey, Calif.; Mrs. Harold (Evalynn) Watts, Weed Heigh, Nev.; Mrs. Kelton (Donna) Peck and Mrs. Roger (Hazel) Edwards, both of Mi
