1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Henrik was oldest son of Tobias and Anna Molaug. He married Bergny Vistnes from Kvernevik, Stavanger, and had two chldr.Tor and Åsta. Åsta died at an accident only 19 years old. Tor (ships-machinist) married Ingfri
2 CONC d Dagsland (Stavanger).They lived at Trinidad and later at San Francisco,Cal. Had 3 children: Torunn, Inger, Eric. Ingfried died 1965 in Cal. and Tor later married Romayne Wolff. Son Eric died at an accident 1990 at Port Orchard (
2 CONC Seattle.Wa.)Torunn and Inger both married married and lie in Cal.U.S. Bergny died in 1929. Henrik re-married in 1936 Inga Søndenå from Foldøy, Rogaland,Norway.Had 3 children: Daughter Astrid(1937) Married Olav Gyland from Sira,Nor
2 CONC way.They run a local grocery shop at Madla.She had 4 sons. Son Erling (1940) seaman (radio/commications). Norw.Naval Air Force: electronic air opr./nav. - Married Gerd Elise Hokstad of Stavanger. Two children: Bjørn and Hilde. You
2 CONC ngest child; Helge (1946), master of economics, married Elisabeth Hartin of Arboga,Sweden; two adopted daughters:Andrea and Julia (of Korean heritage)
