1 NAME Trygve "Ted" Tobiason /Molaug/
2 GIVN Trygve "Ted" Tobiason
2 SURN Molaug
2 _MARNM Molaug
2 NICK Ted
2 NICK Grygve Molang
2 NICK Trygue Molaug
2 NICK Trygve Molaug
1 SEX M
1 OCCU Constr.eng.
2 PLAC ?/?/Aramco
