1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Arthur Elvin Thorson was born on May 31, 1891, in Stoughton, Wisconsin. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Arthur enlisted in the Army June 14, 1918 and was discharged on January 14, 1919. He was a corporal at Camp Custer in Michigan.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Amelia Peterson on November 15, 1918, in Badger, Iowa. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on December 31, 1953, in Fort Dodge, Iowa, at the age of 62, and was buried there.
