1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Census 1865 / 1865-telling for 1039 Herred   Klungeland gård  126a1, 126b1a  [http://digitalarkivet.no/cgi-win/WebCens.exe?slag=visbase&sidenr=8&filnamn=f61039&gardpostnr=176&merk=176#ovre]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Hans Pedersen (1814-1895) aka Hans Pedersen of Log; aka Hans Log Pedersen (b. before June 26, 1814, Log farm, Herad parish, Farsund, Vest-Agder, Norway - d. 1895, Klungeland farm, Herad parish, Farsund, Vest-Agder, Norway) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: Hans was the son of Peder Andreas Hansen (1790-1849) of Log; and Maren Sophia Olsdatter (1791-1868) of Gullestad. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Baptism: Hans was baptised on June 26, 1814 at Herad, Vest-Agder, Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings: Hans had the following siblings: Pernille Helene Pedersdatter (1812) who died as an infant; Anna Pedersdatter (1816-1831); Olene Andrea Pedersdatter (1819-1912) who married Villum Larsen (1816-1896); Ole Mathias Pedersen
2 CONC  (1822-1914) who married Thea Johanne Torstensdatter (1825-1865); Helene Elisabeth Pedersdatter (1825-?); Peder Pedersen (1829-c1830) who died as an infant; Peder Andreas Pedersen (1831-?) who married Serine Larsen (1840-?) aka Se
2 CONC verina Larsdatter; and Hans Elias Pedersen (1837-?). 
2 CONT
2 CONT First Marriage: Hans married Anne Marie Berntsdatter (1827-1884) on March 15, 1853 in Herad, Vest-Agder, Norway. She was listed as "Anne Marie Bernt Tobiasdatter", and he was listed as "Hans Pedersen". Anne was the daughter of Ber
2 CONC nt Tobias Haagensen of Gjerstad farm. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: Together Anne and Hans had the following children: Peder Martin Hansen (1853-?); Bernt Andreas Hansen (1855-1915) who married Anne Elisabeth Kristensdatter (1860-1942) of Egilstad farm; Anne Martine Hansen I (1858) who d
2 CONC ied as an infant; Hans Elias Hansen (1860-?) who married a Trøyborg; Anne Martine Hansen II (1863-?); and Hans Emanuel Hansen (1866-?). All the children were baptised at Herad parish.
2 CONT
2 CONT Klungland farm, Farsund, Norway: The Herad Bygdebok, lists Peder Andreas Hansen of Log selling "bruksnr 2" (Farm Parcel #2) on Klungland to his son Hans Pedersen of Log. Hans and Anne Marie appear in the 1865 Norway Census living 
2 CONC at Klungland farm, Herad parish, Farsund, Vest-Agder, Norway. She is listed as "Anne Marie Berntsdatter" and he is listed as "Hans Pedersen".
2 CONT
2 CONT Second Marriage: Hans married Kristiane Johannesdatter of Klungland farm on November 04, 1884 at Herad parish, Vest-Agder, Norway. She was the daughter of Johannes Tellifsen, and this was the second marriage for both of them.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: Hans died in 1895 at Klungland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Klungland farm, Farsund, Norway: His son, Bernt Andreas Hansen, took over the farm until his own death in 1915. The farm was then taken over by Hans Johnsen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Relationship: Hans Pedersen (1814-1895) was the second great-granduncle of Richard Arthur Norton (1958- ). 
