1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alice Paula Schneider (1913-2002) aka Alice Violetta Schneider (b. March 31, 1913, 9th Street, Greenwich Village, Manhattan, New York City, New York, USA - d. September 23, 2002, Melbourne, Brevard County, Florida,
2 CONC  USA) Social Security Number 137264196.
2 CONT
2 CONT Name:
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born as Alice Paula Schneider, but at one point in time went by the name Alice Violetta Schneider.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Emil August Schneider (1886-1955), a banker born in Bielefeld, Germany and Inga Pedersen (1885-1927), who was born in Farsund, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sibling:
2 CONT
2 CONT Her brother was Eddie August Schneider (1911-1940), a record setting aviator.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage:
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John Harms (1905-1985) and had three children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Her son was: Robert Edward Harms (1941-2001).
2 CONT
2 CONT Death:
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 2002 in Florida, and was buried in Sylvan Abbey Memorial Park in Clearwater, Florida. She was listed as "Alice P. Harms".
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT Researched and written by Richard Arthur Norton (1958- ) for Findagrave and loaded here at Geni.com on October 4, 2009. Last updated by Richard Arthur Norton (1958- ) on December 5, 2008 with "Paula" as her middle name.
