1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This profile is for Esther Hansdatter Kragenes (f.Feb1750 Haaland, Feda), g.m. Ole Jonsen Krogenes u. Lunde, Vanse.  She was born in Feda to Hans Didriksen Haaland (f.Skranefjell, Feda, d.01ded1803 Haaland) and is 
2 CONC mentioned in Hans' 1803 skifte as g.m. "Ole Lunde i Lister" and later noted in the skifte as "Ole Jonsen Kraagenes".  This firmly ties Ester H. Krogenes to Esther H. (f.1750 Haaland,  Feda)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Hans Didriksen Feda (f. Skranefjell Feda (gnr30), d.1Dec1803 Håland, Feda)
2 CONT ** Feda bygdebok, Haaland, s.507, bnr18,19,20:
2 CONT ** 3rd owner: Marte Osmundsdatter (f.1716, d./sk.1754), g.1748.m. Hans Didriksen Skranefjell
2 CONT *** 3barn: Ester(f1750), Osmund(f1751),Anne(f.1754?,d.1820)
2 CONT
2 CONT * 22feb1750 dobte paa Feda: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/16898/23
2 CONT ** Barn: Ester (f.01Feb1750 Haaand, Feda)
2 CONT ** Far: Hans Haaland
2 CONT ** Test.: Reier ibid og Gunil ibid, Anders Skranefjeld, ...
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1782 fadder paa dopt i Feda? https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/16898/42
2 CONT ** Ester i Rorvig
2 CONT
2 CONT * 30Mar1784 Viede: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/9881/204
2 CONT ** Ole Jonsen (___mand paa Østhassel) og Ester Hansdatter
2 CONT ** Fadder: : Omund(?) Nielsen Westhassel, Lars ___ Hanss.(?) ibid, Ola Stillufs.(?) Hananger, Olla Abrahams. Westhassel.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 09jan1785 dobte paa Vanse: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/9881/217
2 CONT ** Barn: Inger Mathea (f.06jan1785)
2 CONT ** Far: Ole Jonss. Kragenes
2 CONT ** Test.: Ole Mathiass. Hananger, Jon Jacobss. Maberg, Abel ___dtr Hananger, Marthe Maria Jensd. Vindem
2 CONT
2 CONT * 17Jun1787 Baptism, Vanse: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/9881/253
2 CONT ** Barn: Johanne Maria (f.15Jun1787);
2 CONT ** Far: Ola Jons.Kraagenes;
2 CONT ** Fadder: Anna (Arne?) Kolbensd.(?) fra Arendal, Ola Mathias. Hananger, Jorun Rasmusdtr Brae(?), ___ Maria Ostre Houe og Magnu Gundersd. ibid [Ostre Houe]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * 15nov1789 dobte paa Vanse: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/9881/290
2 CONT ** Barn: Aaselena (f.13nov1789)
2 CONT ** Far: Ole Jonsen Kragenes
2 CONT ** Test.: ___ Major Holfeld, Jan Jacobss. Maberg, Anders Lunde, jomfru Elisab. Holfeldt og Martha Maria  Windem(?)
2 CONT
2 CONT * 04nov1792 dobte paa Vanse: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/9881/339
2 CONT ** Barn: Johan Nathanael "Daniel" (f.29oct1792)
2 CONT ** Far: Ole Jonsen Kragenas
2 CONT ** Test.: ___ ____ Woxvold, Soren Olss. Hananger, Jon Jacobss. Kragenes(?), Martha Hansd. Woxvold og Gunild Maria Olsdr. Hananger
2 CONT ** NOTE: Ester had a half sister, Marta Hansdtr. (f.1756 Haaland, Feda).  The witness above at Woxvold couldl be her.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1801 Telling 0033 Lunde, Vanse: https://www.digitalarkivet.no/census/person/pf01058344001127
2 CONT ** Far: Ole Johnsen (45yrs) - 1g, har hus med jord
2 CONT ** Mor: Ester Hansdatter (51yrs), 1g.
2 CONT ** 4 barn
2 CONT
2 CONT * 01dec1803 skifte etter faren Hans Didrichsen Haaland: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/24469/614
