1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Probable match in Feda: https://www.geni.com/people/Ole-Kragenes-i-Vanse/6000000225451431822 (f~1760 Nuland i Nes or Fosseland, Feda) --- Nuland in Nesboka notes Jon Olsen Fosseland g.1757.m. Astrid Nielsdatter Nul
2 CONC and.  Fosseland in Fedaboka notes Astrid Nielsdatter g.m. Jon Olsen Fosseland (sk.1763) with 2 sons ---Ole (3 1/2 aar) and Niels ( 1 1/2 aar).  Niels Jonsen baptised in Feda, married, remained at Fosseland and had several children
2 CONC .  What became of Ole is not mentioned.  Fosseland is across the water from Haaland where Ester Hansdatter came from.  There was an Ole born to a Johannes in Feda in early 1761 https://www.geni.com/people/Ole-Johannessen-Raustad/6
2 CONC 000000006021218001 but he married and stayed at Ytre Raustad.  Note: What makes this likely match intriguing is that it would explain DNA matches between living decendents of Ole Jonsen Kraagenes and Niels Jonsen Fosseland.  Since
2 CONC  Ole Jonsen Kraagenes married Esther Hansdatter from Haaland in Feda, it makes sense that Ole Jonsen also came from Feda.
2 CONT
2 CONT Earlier: Denne profilen er for Ole Jonsen (f~1757), b. Kraagenes og Osthassel i 1780-1800's.  Ole g.m. Ester Hansdatter (f~1750 Skranefjell i Feda/Kvinesdal).  Ulland gaard er naer Skranefjel og minst de 2km SE.  Mulig han var son
2 CONC nen til en bror til Salve Jonsen, navnet Jon.  Ellers, en https://www.geni.com/people/Jon-Jonsen-Ulland/6000000206444888854 (Hydra i Flekkefjord) og hustru mulig vart foreldrene.
2 CONT Guess: Joen Jonsen (Vatland it Feda og far til Salve) had a son named Joen, born around 1700.  This Joen Jonsen was father to Ole Jonsen Kragenes.  Ole Johnsen Kragenes g.m. Ester Hansdatter, datter til Hans Didrichsen Haaland (F.
2 CONC Skranefjeld)---both Ole and Ester are mentioned in the 1803 skifte after Hans Didrichsen Haaland.  Ostre Nordhassel i Vanse var eide i Haalands slekt i Feda.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1783 skiftekort for Kragenes u. Lunde: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/39943/24473
2 CONT ** Ole Jonsen ikke nevnt
2 CONT
2 CONT * 30Mar1784 Viede: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/9881/204
2 CONT ** u.k. Ole Jonsen ( ___mand paa Østhassel) og pige Ester Hansdatter
2 CONT ** Fadder: : Omund(?) Niels. Westhassel, Lars Westhassel___ Jans.(?) ibid, https://www.geni.com/people/Ole-Stilluvsen-Hananger/6000000192012337857 , https://www.geni.com/people/Othe-Abrahamsen/6000000116765155914 Westhassel
2 CONT
2 CONT * By Jan 1785 we find them at Kragenes with birth of first barn.  We also find as witnesses at baptisms people from gaard Woxvold.  In 1793, at baptism of Jon Woxvold's son Niels Henrich, Ole Jonsen Kraagenes is the first witness:
2 CONC  https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/9881/347
2 CONT
